{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56160","headline":"楚词颂 · 杜光庭","name":"楚词颂","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"衆生多障难，大道甚矜怜。\n救度留科戒，咸令忏罪缘。\n愆辜编地府，衅结已闻天。\n发露祈真佑，精诚仰圣贤。\n虔恭礼三宝，愿当奏延年。\n焚词归上界，奏名玉帝前。\n（同前卷四九。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜光庭","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56160.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56160","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}